      },
      "message": "Merge issue/3645-component-library into issue/3647-component-mcp-tools\n\nConflict: crates/app/tests/tool_library_holders.rs (both module lists\nkept). Hand edits for the #4249 fields that the parent now carries:\n- DocumentComponent literals use DocumentComponent::new.\n- upsert_tool_component lands the stated milling / running keys through\n  UpsertDocumentComponent::with_row; an unstated key keeps the held value\n  and the library link stays.\n- save_library_component goes through LibraryComponent::from_row, which\n  refuses a row with cutter facts or running data by name.\n- Pinned by mcp_upsert_carries_insert_running_data_and_a_library_save_refuses_it.\n\nRefs #3647\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
